Third-party code in this folder
===============================

xexmerge.cc, logstub.cc, Makefile — this project, MIT (see ../../LICENSE).

xexmerge.cc is a standalone program whose algorithm is a port of Xenia's XEX loader:
`src/xenia/cpu/xex_module.cc` (`ReadImage`, `ApplyPatch`), `src/xenia/cpu/lzx.cc` and
the structure definitions in `src/xenia/kernel/util/xex2_info.h`.

